ADDITIONAL NOTICE - MODEL WEIGHTS AND CLINICAL USE

The trained model weights distributed via GitHub Releases (vit_seg_best.pth,
vit_seg_augmented_best.pth) were trained on de-identified urine cytology
images covered by a clinical data-use agreement with Cedars-Sinai Medical
Center. The weights are released for non-commercial research and educational
use only and must NOT be used for clinical diagnosis, screening, or any other
patient-facing decision-making without the appropriate regulatory clearance
(e.g., FDA 510(k) in the United States).

